comment
Movement
* Movement is key in Satie - this will give the mix depth and dynamics
endcomment


loop ambience/playground
    volume goto(0and.2 in 10)

3 * oneshot animal/cow/1to2 every 6to12 # notice that you can also multiply and object
    volume goto(0and0.1to0.15 in .5)
    pitch 0.8to1.2
    move walk # walk simply makes the object move in X and Z - not Y
    visual cube

oneshot animal/bird/5 every 5to10
    volume goto(0and0.1 in .5)
    pitch 0.6to0.8
    move fly speed 1 # makes the object also move in the Y axis, notice that you can also add speed
    visual trail


oneshot ppiano/1to10 every 10to15
    volume goto(0and0.2 in .5)
    move x -10to10 y 0to15 z -10to5 speed 2to3 # here we're establishing ranges for movement in X, Y, and Z
    visual trail
    color red gobetween(0and255 as incubic in 20) green 255 blue 100